        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Disney Magazine, The Ring, Disney Adventures\n- Companies: Golden Boy Enterprises, Disney\n- People: Oscar De La Hoya\n- Topics: Magazine publishing, ownership\n\nFacts:\n- The Ring is an American boxing magazine that was first published in 1922 as a boxing and wrestling magazine.\n- Disney Magazine was an official Disney magazine that was published quarterly from December 1965 to April 2005.\n- Golden Boy Enterprises, owned by Oscar De La Hoya, acquired The Ring in 2007.\n- Disney Adventures should not be confused with the now defunct Disney Magazine.",
